px !important; display: none !important;\" alt=\"\"/></body></html>",
          "text": "Hi there,\n\nPlease find your license key below to unlock selected paid features on your community edition of n8n. \n\n****************\nYour license key\n****************\n\ned3951f2-c1cf-4233-8ea6-fca83cf1bb73\n\nActivate License Key ( http://localhost:5678/settings/usage?key=ed3951f2-c1cf-4233-8ea6-fca83cf1bb73 )Getting started and what happens next:\n\n* Activate Your License: Use the button above or copy and paste the license key into settings → usage → plan → enter activation key.\nYou have 14 days to activate your license.\n*\nExplore Features: Take a look the features you've unlocked, Workflow history ( https://docs.n8n.io/workflows/history/ ), Debug in editor ( https://docs.n8n.io/workflows/executions/debug/ ), Folders ( https://docs.n8n.io/release-notes/#n8n1850 ) and custom execution search ( https://docs.n8n.io/workflows/executions/custom-executions-data/ ).\n* Unlocked for life: You'll have life time access to these features\nNeed Help?\n\nOur community forum ( https://community.n8n.io/ ) and docs ( https://docs.n8n.io/ ) are the best place to to ask questions and find out more about using n8n!\n\nHappy automating!\nThe n8n Team\n\n CustomCustomCustomCustomAutomate without limits\n\nn8n GmbH, Novalisstraße 10, 10115 Berlin, Germany\n©2025 n8n GmbH, all rights reserved\n\nUnsubscribe ( https://assets.parceldns.com/design-studio-marshaled-preview/%7B%%20unsubscribe%20%%7D ) View email in browser ( https://assets.parceldns.com/design-studio-marshaled-preview/%7B%%20view_in_browser_url%20%%7D )",
